<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Event Reminder</title>
</head>

<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background:#f5f5f5; padding:20px;">

  <div style="
    max-width:600px;
    margin:auto;
    background:white;
    padding:30px;
    border-radius:10px;
  ">

    <h2>
      Hi {{name}} 👋
    </h2>

    <p>
      This is a reminder that your event is coming soon.
    </p>


    <div style="
      background:#f8f9fa;
      padding:20px;
      border-radius:8px;
      margin:20px 0;
    ">

      <h3>{{eventName}}</h3>

      <p>
        📅 <strong>Date:</strong>
        {{eventDate}}
      </p>

      <p>
        📍 <strong>Location:</strong>
        {{location}}
      </p>

      <p>
        ⏰ <strong>Reminder:</strong>
        {{reminderType}}
      </p>

    </div>


    <p>
      Don't forget to bring your ticket QR Code when attending the event.
    </p>


    <p>
      See you there! 🎉
    </p>


    <hr />

    <small style="color:#777;">
      This email was sent automatically by Event Ticketing System.
    </small>

  </div>

</body>
</html>